<h2 id="toc3"><span>Note:</span></h2>
<p>This is a Black Highlighter based theme. You will need to import the Black Highlighter theme as well in order to use this theme. <a href="/theme:black-highlighter-theme">To learn more go here.</a></p>
<p>On any wiki:</p>
<div class="code">
<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-wiki:theme:black-highlighter-theme]]</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-wiki:theme:redtape</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|dark=--]</span> &lt;- This is an optional argument if you would like to use the dark mode version of the theme. If you omit this, it will default to light mode.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|years=XX</span> &lt;- This sets the minutes to midnight in the subheader and the clock. For all articles that subscribe to the REDTAPE timeline, midnight is 2043.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]]</span></p>
</div>
